+These are reserved PostgreSQL156 / SQLite75 source proposals. They are outside
+the runtime migration directories deliberately: inventory155 / inventory74 is
+not present in this tree and must be integrated first. Do not copy these into a
+live migration source or run them as an isolated schema shortcut.
+
+The real acceptance chain is PostgreSQL153→154→155→156 and
+SQLite72→73→74→75, with the complete earlier schema installed before messages.
+No legacy pending row is backfilled or authenticated. Empty DOWN is permitted;
+observed immutable admissions must make DOWN fail while retaining all facts.
+
+The first source slice provides immutable enqueue descriptors, exact pending
+revision/cursor binding, checked task loading and an original transcript reader.
+It is not ready for acceptance. Required next producers include an immutable
+successful checkpoint (including a bootstrap origin), all transitive existing
+memory/topic/tombstone/vector/config origins, multi-session owners, atomic
+derived-origin/output/checkpoint acknowledgment, and queue recovery/redelivery.
+No runtime AutoMigrate or current-row re-signing is provided.
